e puzzles as hints to color in the appropriate squares and complete the illustration to solve them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The handy &quot;X&quot; feature lets you block out squares to keep track of those that shouldn't be colored in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can always review the basic rules within the game if you ever need a refresher course!</p>",
